{
  "heading": "How we choose our wool",
  "meta": "By the Northwind Goods team — March 2024",
  "lead": "Every throw starts as a conversation with a mill, not a spreadsheet. Here's what we actually look for.",
  "width": "narrow",
  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We work with three small mills, each chosen for the same reason: they can tell us exactly which farm a fleece came from. "
          },
          { "type": "text", "text": "Traceability", "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }] },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " isn't a marketing word for us — it's the difference between a throw you keep for a decade and one you don't."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What we look for" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fibre length and crimp, checked by hand" }]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  { "type": "text", "text": "A mill that pays shearers a fair, published rate" }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  { "type": "text", "text": "Undyed lots we can dye small-batch ourselves" }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If we can't tell you which valley it came from, we don't buy it."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "That standard costs more up front. It also means a Northwind throw looks the same in year five as it did on day one."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
